**4. `src/Mod/Material/App/ModelManagerExternal.cpp:120-124`** — **`getModels()` returns empty map (TODO not implemented)**
```cpp
std::shared_ptr<std::map<QString, std::shared_ptr<Model>>> ModelManagerExternal::getModels()
{
    // TODO: Implement an external call
    return std::make_shared<std::map<QString, std::shared_ptr<Model>>>();
}
```
`ModelManager::getModels()` merges external + local models. External side returns empty, so external models never appear in the combined list.

