**6. `src/Mod/Material/App/ModelLoader.cpp:231-234`** — **Throws on non-local libraries during load**
```cpp
if (!model->getLibrary()->isLocal()) {
    throw InvalidLibrary();
}
```
This prevents loading models from external libraries entirely. If external libraries are meant to be readable, this blocks that path.

