### **MODERATE: Design / Safety Concerns**

**9. `src/Mod/Material/App/ModelManagerExternal.cpp:100-114`** — **Caches `nullptr` on failure, never retries**
```cpp
catch (const ModelNotFound& e) {
    _cache.emplace(uuid.toStdString(), nullptr);
    return nullptr;
}
catch (const ConnectionError& e) {
    _cache.emplace(uuid.toStdString(), nullptr);
    return nullptr;
}
```
A transient network error permanently poisons the cache entry. Consider caching only successes, or using a negative-cache TTL.

